[{"answer":"Can I help you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you looking for something in particular?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/2.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, well... first I'm looking for the foreign language section.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, it's right down here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Here we are. \"Foreign Languages\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/5.mp3"},{"answer":"What course are you taking?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Spanish Four Thirty-one.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/7.mp3"},{"answer":"You need the Intermediate Spanish textbook?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/8.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I still have that from Four Thirty.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/9.mp3"},{"answer":"What I'm looking for is the novel we're supposed to read:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Garcia Marquez's 'Cien años de soledad',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/11.mp3"},{"answer":"'One Hundred Years of Solitude'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/12.mp3"},{"answer":"'Garcia Marquez', 'Garcia Marquez'. Hmm. No...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, here it is, under 'Marquez'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/14.mp3"},{"answer":"Here you are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Eighteen dollars?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/16.mp3"},{"answer":"The price is right, but, erm, it's just the text.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/17.mp3"},{"answer":"There doesn't seem to be any footnotes or any glossary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/19.mp3"},{"answer":"This is the only edition you have?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it is. Sorry.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm. How many copies do you have left?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Just those on the shelf?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, uh, four, no, five copies.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Jeez, those'll be gone by Friday for sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/25.mp3"},{"answer":"Our class is really full.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/26.mp3"},{"answer":"What's your return policy?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Would it be OK if I bought this now,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and then returned it if I can find an annotated edition on the internet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, certainly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/30.mp3"},{"answer":"But you'll need to keep your receipt, of course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/31.mp3"},{"answer":"and be sure that the book is not marked up or damaged in any way.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Sure, that's fair enough.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you want me to check whether we can find you another edition?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/34.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think I have time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It usually takes so long to get a book through a bookstore.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Haha, unfortunately, that's often true.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll take this then, and say, you have, uh, sweatshirts, don't you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Sweatshirts? Yes, in the 'School Spirit' section.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/40.mp3"},{"answer":"Over this way. And down here. Um...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/41.mp3"},{"answer":"Here you are.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah. Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Hmm... that's not much of a school crest.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh. There's a bigger one on the back, see?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/45.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, yeah, of course. I see.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, this is a medium.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I need a large, and uh... I think... in green.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Medium, medium... here, is this a large?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, large. Here you go.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, that's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Say, do you know what our motto means, anyway?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/52.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Ex Pertinacia Veritas\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/53.mp3"},{"answer":"\"Out of something... something-or-other\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/54.mp3"},{"answer":"\"From Determination comes Truth\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/55.mp3"},{"answer":"It's been SU's motto since it was founded in 1894.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/56.mp3"},{"answer":"And this crest is \"an American bison couchant upon a tome vert\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/57.mp3"},{"answer":"What in heck does that mean?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/58.mp3"},{"answer":"A buffalo lying on a green book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I think the idea was that this new pioneer state was getting its first institution of higher education,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/60.mp3"},{"answer":"the buffalo represents the prairies,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/61.mp3"},{"answer":"the green of the book, and the book represents learning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Huh. That's really interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/63.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll wear it with pride, and hope for some of that determination!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/64.mp3"},{"answer":"How much is this?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/65.mp3"},{"answer":"39.95 plus tax.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Uh, what else do I need now?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Mmm... I guess that's it, then: the sweatshirt and the book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/69.mp3"},{"answer":"And there's no tax on the book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/70.mp3"},{"answer":"Where's your register?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/71.mp3"},{"answer":"Just take them up to the cashier at the front, please. Over there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, OK. Thanks a lot for your help.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you. Have a nice day.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/toefl-listening/conversation-7-2023-01-22-22-37-09/74.mp3"}]
